<item><title>Burkina Faso beat Mauritania 3-1 to qualify for CAN 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-beat-mauritania-3-1-to-qualify-for-can-2027-d3f144/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-beat-mauritania-3-1-to-qualify-for-can-2027-d3f144/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>Aboubacar Camara, Franck Lassina Traoré and Elohim Kaboré scored in Nouakchott, securing qualification with two group matches left.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 05:48:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
